## plan
- set up an express application and configure it to listen on port 5000.
- establish a connection to an sqlite3 database and create tables for storing cart and item data.
- implement the `/create_cart` endpoint to generate a new cart and return a unique cart id.
- implement the `/add_to_cart` endpoint to add or remove items from a specified cart.
